# OverKart Library (shared copy)

This directory is the live OverKart Library, compiled with **IDO** and linked into the mk64 ELF. It is not the GCC/Armips sibling `Library/` tree.

Read **`AGENTS.md`** at the repo root. RAM: `docs/memory_map.md`. Host contract: `docs/host_overrides.md`.

This directory must match the same folder in AmpedUpDecomp, OverKartDecomp, and LibraryDecomp. `OverKartDefaults.h` stays here. `OverKartDefaults.c` does **not** — host bodies live outside this folder. Vanilla already calls the `*Default` names.

Vanilla C must include `OverKartHooks.h`, not `MainInclude.h`.

## Hard constraints

- Do not fork, specialize, or host-patch files here. Host differences belong in `src/AmpedUp/`, `src/OverKart5/`, vanilla hooks, or the host Defaults body.
- Tarmac course headers, object layouts, and `ok_HeaderROM` `0xBE9178` are frozen.
- Do not invent new RAM without asking. Do not relocate FB or Z. `ok_FreeSpace` is non-course scratch.
- NTSC only for Tarmac and custom levels.
- Do not clean, modernize, or delete “unused” Library code. KartCheck and CameraCheck are host-owned.
- IDO only. Do not switch to GCC. Do not change ABI or microcode unless asked.
